# Vendored third-party dependencies (glm / glfw / assimp / freetype / tinygltf /
# stb_image / tiny_obj_loader) are deliberately versioned: the framework
# extension layer in extensions/ must build from a fresh clone with no external
# SDK checkout.  Only transient local backups are ignored.
/external/*.bak
/external/**/*.bak
.externalNativeBuild
.vscode
*.doc
*.docx
/shader/*.hpp
